; Split-horizon zone for n8n.sogode.com, the Sogode business n8n.
;
; Publicly an A/AAAA to ruby (not a CNAME: the name also carries the MX and
; SPF of its mail domain, hosted on ruby), which reverse-proxies webhooks
; and forms to moby over wgclient1 - homelab/moby/ruby. Inside the lab it
; resolves to moby, whose nginx fronts the n8n-sogode stack with a lab-CA
; certificate carrying this name. Only the addresses are overridden: the
; lab sends no mail to this domain directly, so MX and TXT stay public-only.
;
; sogode.com is DNSSEC-signed, so this needs a matching addNTA() on Delphi
; or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN n8n.sogode.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026102801  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.8.27             ; moby
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:1000:be24:11ff:fe13:54b8 ; moby's ULA
